# =============================================================================
# testbed/configs/.gitignore
# =============================================================================
# Exclude the generated/ directory from version control.
#
# Reason: render_configs.py writes rendered strongSwan configuration files
# into configs/generated/<scenario_id>/. These files contain:
#   - Pre-Shared Keys (ipsec.secrets, swanctl.conf secrets block)
#   - Host-specific paths
#   - Scenario-specific runtime state
#
# The templates/ directory IS tracked (it contains no secrets).
# The generated/ directory is NEVER tracked.
# =============================================================================

# Exclude all rendered scenario configs
generated/

# Exclude any accidentally created .pem / .key files
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Exclude charon log files if they end up here
*.log
